<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.1.1>	Hic est dies, in quo Christi precioso
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.1.2>	Est in sanguine redemptus mundus totus,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.1.3>	In quo ouem que errauit pastor bonus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.1.4>	Ad ouile reportauit ulnis sacris.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.1.5>	De sepulchro resurrexit pastor bonus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.2.1>	Vna sabati surrexit ualde mane,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.2.2>	Sic aparuit Mariae Magdalenae,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.2.3>	Que discipulis occurrens nuntiauit:
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.2.4>	"Vere dominus surrexit, sicut dixit."
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.2.5>	De sepulchro resurrexit pastor bonus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.3.1>	Mortis nuncium per stultam mulierem
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.3.2>	A paradyso suscepit mundus olim,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.3.3>	Dignum fuit ut per bonam mulierem
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.3.4>	A sepulchro uitam mundus obaudiret.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.3.5>	De sepulchro resurrexit pastor bonus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.4.1>	Mors in orbem introiuit sub peccato,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.4.2>	Quod commisit primus homo per mandatum,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.4.3>	Et ab illo usque Christum perdurauit,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.4.4>	Qui per crucem uitam mundi reuocauit.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.4.5>	De sepulchro resurrexit pastor bonus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.5.1>	Adam uetitum cum lignum usurparet,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.5.2>	Mortem nobis propinauit. Sed dum lignum
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.5.3>	Christus crucis contrectauit, uitam nobis
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.5.4>	In perpetuo firmauit et donauit.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.5.5>	De sepulchro resurrexit pastor bonus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.6.1>	Serpens callidus gularum fraude primum
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.6.2>	In paradyso decepit protoplaustum,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.6.3>	Christus patri obediuit usque ad mortem
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.6.4>	Et cum <morte> triumphauit sic serpentem.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.6.5>	De sepulchro resurrexit pastor bonus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.7.1>	Nam regnauit mors ab Adam et in eos,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.7.2>	Quos non propria peccata polluerunt,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.7.3>	Sed sub uinculo delicti protoplausti
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.7.4>	Descendebant ad infernum et electi.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.7.5>	De sepulchro resurrexit pastor bonus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.8.1>	Christus passus est pro nobis et auctorem
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.8.2>	Mortis sua morte uicit et deleuit
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.8.3>	Mox cirographum peccati, quod infelix
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.8.4>	Homo tulit a serpente, cum cecidit.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.8.5>	De sepulchro resurrexit pastor bonus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.9.1>	Nam cum caro in sepulchro quieuisset,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.9.2>	Portas tartari potenter Christus fregit,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.9.3>	Inde electos liberauit et in sanctam
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.9.4>	Ciuitatem collocauit inmortales.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.9.5>	De sepulchro resurrexit pastor bonus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.10.1>	Hoc misterium qui possit estimare?
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.10.2>	Ante celos nec electus penetrauit,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.10.3>	Modo eciam latroni paradisi
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.10.4>	Christus portas est dignatus aperire.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.10.5>	De sepulchro resurrexit pastor bonus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.11.1>	Iudas impie crudelis latro dire,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.11.2>	Lupe rapax et inmitis inimice,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.11.3>	Penas lues sub geenna infinitas,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.11.4>	Qui necare uitam mundi cupiebas.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.11.5>	De sepulchro resurrexit pastor bonus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.12.1>	Vita nostra resurrexit de sepulcro,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.12.2>	Cum qua simul resurrexit omnis mundus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.12.3>	Suis ictibus perculsa inimica
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.12.4>	Iam perisse solam modo mors se gemat.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.12.5>	De sepulchro resurrexit pastor bonus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.13.1>	Gens nefanda Iudeorum tristis modo
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.13.2>	Debet flere et in luctu permanere,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.13.3>	Que demittere latronem expetiuit
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.13.4>	Et auctorem mundi clamat crucifigi.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.13.5>	De sepulchro resurrexit pastor bonus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.14.1>	Nos oportet exultare, uiri fratres,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.14.2>	Et feliciter in Christo iocundari,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.14.3>	Qui purpureo cruore nos redemit
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.14.4>	Et ad aurea celorum regna misit.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 9.14.5>	De sepulchro resurrexit pastor bonus.
